WEBVTT

00:00:10.150 --> 00:00:13.450
I don't believe this! It's more than 300 meters tall!

00:00:14.110 --> 00:00:15.240
Jesus!

00:00:15.700 --> 00:00:16.740
That must be...

00:00:17.120 --> 00:00:18.280
No question about it!

00:00:18.700 --> 00:00:20.910
It invaded Earth two years ago.

00:00:21.330 --> 00:00:24.420
It murdered both my mother and father!

00:00:25.250 --> 00:00:26.540
It's EI-01!

00:00:35.220 --> 00:00:37.550
O, you weak-willed souls...

00:00:37.640 --> 00:00:39.140
The time has come!

00:00:41.020 --> 00:00:44.810
Pasdar, who had been secretly manipulating the Four Machine Kings...

00:00:44.890 --> 00:00:47.110
...has finally revealed himself.

00:00:47.190 --> 00:00:51.860
Now the final battle, unprecedented in scale, is about to begin on Earth!

00:00:52.150 --> 00:00:55.150
Ga-Ga-Ga, Ga-Ga-Ga, GaoGaiGar!

00:00:55.150 --> 00:00:58.050
Ga-Ga-Ga, Ga-Ga-Ga-Ga, GaoGaiGar!!

00:00:58.990 --> 00:01:04.910
King of Braves GaoGaiGar

00:01:05.400 --> 00:01:09.050
Rise in fury, Steel Cyborg!

00:01:11.170 --> 00:01:15.770
With your red mane and golden arms!

00:01:17.090 --> 00:01:20.050
Your G-Stone sparkling in the sun...

00:01:20.050 --> 00:01:24.970
All the world's hope is in your hands.

00:01:24.970 --> 00:01:28.890
Your time has come to make a stand!

00:01:28.890 --> 00:01:31.690
Crushing the hopes of the people...

00:01:31.690 --> 00:01:35.450
The Zonders will pay the price!

00:01:37.600 --> 00:01:40.450
Ga-Ga-Ga, Ga-Ga-Ga, GaoGaiGar!

00:01:40.450 --> 00:01:43.620
Ga-Ga-Ga, Ga-Ga-Ga-Ga, GaoGaiGar!!

00:01:43.620 --> 00:01:46.160
Final Fusion, approved!

00:01:46.360 --> 00:01:49.290
Now transform into a superhero!

00:01:49.290 --> 00:01:52.250
Warping dimensional space!

00:01:52.500 --> 00:01:56.330
Dividing Driver!

00:01:58.150 --> 00:02:03.970
A miracle! A mystery! The truth! A dream!

00:02:03.970 --> 00:02:09.850
A gigantic, invincible guardian is born!

00:02:09.850 --> 00:02:12.800
Our very own King of Braves!

00:02:12.800 --> 00:02:16.690
Ga-Ga-Ga-Ga, GaoGaiGar!!

00:02:16.110 --> 00:02:18.610
This is the story of the brave men and women...

00:02:18.700 --> 00:02:20.950
...who fight with all their hearts to save mankind.

00:02:24.080 --> 00:02:24.120
Brave Robots, Death at Dawn!

00:02:25.160 --> 00:02:27.290
<i>Brave Robots, Death at Dawn!</i>

00:02:48.100 --> 00:02:49.060
It's a giant!

00:02:52.860 --> 00:02:54.730
It's the Demon King, Satan!

00:03:01.660 --> 00:03:04.080
Don't tell me he's absorbed the whole city!

00:03:04.160 --> 00:03:05.990
It's like he's made himself a gigantic fortress!

00:03:06.330 --> 00:03:08.200
Or perhaps you should call it a spaceship.

00:03:08.580 --> 00:03:11.620
He's using the lifelines running underneath the Tokyo area...

00:03:11.710 --> 00:03:13.710
...to build a giant spaceship.

00:03:15.380 --> 00:03:16.880
Miss Utsugi, where's Gai?

00:03:17.670 --> 00:03:19.760
He's not responding.

00:03:20.380 --> 00:03:22.090
What's going on with HyoRyu and EnRyu?

00:03:22.140 --> 00:03:24.180
They're undergoing repairs on board...

00:03:24.260 --> 00:03:25.430
...the Amphibious Armored Maintenance Vehicle.

00:03:25.470 --> 00:03:27.180
It's going to take another 20 minutes.

00:03:27.270 --> 00:03:28.930
Wait, we can finish in 10 minutes!

00:03:29.350 --> 00:03:32.770
Make it quick. If we don't hurry, all of the surviving residents of Tokyo...

00:03:32.810 --> 00:03:34.060
...will fall prey to EI-01!

00:04:02.720 --> 00:04:03.800
Volfogg!

00:04:03.970 --> 00:04:05.140
So you made it!

00:04:05.470 --> 00:04:10.520
Yes. Fortunately, EI-01 absorbing everything in Tokyo saved me.

00:04:10.600 --> 00:04:12.440
However, I won't last much longer.

00:04:13.520 --> 00:04:18.730
Captain Gai, please get Special Agent Mamoru out of here.

00:04:18.940 --> 00:04:21.690
Are you crazy? How can I abandon my own comrade?

00:04:21.860 --> 00:04:22.900
Volfogg!

00:04:30.580 --> 00:04:31.540
Galeon!

00:04:35.630 --> 00:04:36.170
Galeon!

00:04:39.210 --> 00:04:40.250
Volfogg, look...

00:04:40.340 --> 00:04:43.840
Galeon's showing us where we've got to go, and he's gonna clear the way!

00:04:46.180 --> 00:04:48.810
He's leading us to an unknown, alien place, isn't he?

00:05:09.280 --> 00:05:12.160
EI-01 is using the supply lines from the power plants...

00:05:12.200 --> 00:05:14.210
...to store vast amounts of energy inside himself!

00:05:16.370 --> 00:05:19.630
He's gathering enough energy to escape into outer space!

00:05:22.000 --> 00:05:25.010
Is there nothing we can do but stand around and watch?

00:05:25.170 --> 00:05:27.340
Can you hear me? Main Order Room!

00:05:28.680 --> 00:05:30.560
Gai! So you're safe!

00:05:32.640 --> 00:05:34.560
Yes! So are Mamoru and Galeon...

00:05:34.850 --> 00:05:36.560
Volfogg is with me, too!

00:05:37.190 --> 00:05:39.360
Sorry to make you worry, Mikoto!

00:05:39.770 --> 00:05:40.820
Thank goodness!

00:05:41.610 --> 00:05:44.030
So you survived after all, Volfogg!

00:05:44.860 --> 00:05:46.990
Chief, I know what the situation is.

00:05:47.200 --> 00:05:49.370
I want you to let me launch the GaoMachines right away.

00:05:49.700 --> 00:05:51.910
We can't let the enemy get away like this.

00:05:52.660 --> 00:05:55.080
And we've got to settle the score from two years ago!

00:05:56.750 --> 00:05:58.920
Gai! You've got to get maintenance work done...

00:05:59.000 --> 00:06:00.290
There's no time for that!

00:06:00.420 --> 00:06:03.550
If we don't finish this now, it's gonna set us right back where we started!

00:06:04.460 --> 00:06:06.720
Mamoru, would you mind making some adjustments to Gai?

00:06:07.090 --> 00:06:07.590
Okay!

00:06:09.140 --> 00:06:11.720
HyoRyu and EnRyu's repairs are complete.

00:06:11.800 --> 00:06:14.220
All of the GaoMachines are ready for launch, as well!

00:06:14.970 --> 00:06:16.100
Very well.

00:06:16.930 --> 00:06:17.890
People...

00:06:18.310 --> 00:06:21.770
We are about to engage the enemy Zonderian in a final, decisive battle.

00:06:21.980 --> 00:06:26.400
I want all of you here to remember that you're the planet's last hope.

00:06:26.940 --> 00:06:29.610
I'm ordering you to go all-out in this battle!

00:06:29.660 --> 00:06:33.950
You must do whatever you can to stop EI-01 from taking off into space!

00:06:34.660 --> 00:06:38.120
The only option we have left is victory!

00:06:39.250 --> 00:06:41.040
Gutsy Geoid Guard

00:06:41.130 --> 00:06:42.130
Final Campaign...

00:06:42.210 --> 00:06:43.130
Commence

00:06:43.170 --> 00:06:44.090
Roger!

00:07:10.110 --> 00:07:11.990
GaiGar!

00:07:15.990 --> 00:07:18.750
Symmetrical Docking!

00:07:24.500 --> 00:07:28.340
ChoRyuJin!

00:07:32.220 --> 00:07:35.640
Final Fusion!

00:07:58.080 --> 00:08:01.080
GaoGaiGar!

00:08:07.750 --> 00:08:09.510
Dr. Liger! Hurry up!

00:08:09.670 --> 00:08:12.510
I've got to go help GaiGar and the others!

00:08:12.590 --> 00:08:14.680
All right, all right! Don't rush me like that!

00:08:14.930 --> 00:08:16.970
Hey, everybody! It's GaoGaiGar!

00:08:17.100 --> 00:08:19.390
Then he's come to save Tokyo, right?

00:08:19.470 --> 00:08:20.890
My Super-cool Dreamboat!

00:08:21.730 --> 00:08:22.810
Mamoru...

00:08:25.230 --> 00:08:27.690
It's that North Pole Lion again...

00:08:28.610 --> 00:08:29.900
Hey, maybe...

00:08:30.070 --> 00:08:30.900
Huh?

00:08:31.490 --> 00:08:36.530
Maybe that North Pole Lion's been looking after Mamoru all this time.

00:08:37.070 --> 00:08:38.080
What?

00:08:45.290 --> 00:08:47.000
Sorry to keep you waiting, ChoRyuJin!

00:08:47.670 --> 00:08:50.710
Hey, I hope you haven't forgotten all about me!

00:08:52.670 --> 00:08:55.630
I have long waited for this day to come.

00:08:57.430 --> 00:09:02.600
You weak-willed humans, you shall now know my power!

00:09:03.600 --> 00:09:07.350
I'm gonna pay you back and then some for two years ago!

00:09:07.520 --> 00:09:09.730
Broken Magnum!

00:09:16.950 --> 00:09:17.910
Double Gun!

00:09:18.120 --> 00:09:19.280
Marg Cannon!

00:09:21.370 --> 00:09:23.450
Destruction Rate of the Barrier System, zero!

00:09:23.540 --> 00:09:24.870
It's not dissipating at all!

00:09:25.330 --> 00:09:27.290
Even after that simultaneous attack?

00:09:32.760 --> 00:09:35.220
He's reached a whole different level than before!

00:09:35.970 --> 00:09:38.090
You foolish humans!

00:09:47.560 --> 00:09:48.810
Wh-What was that?

00:09:49.150 --> 00:09:50.610
With one swing of his arm...

00:09:50.860 --> 00:09:53.110
Did he repel the Brave Robots?

00:09:55.650 --> 00:09:57.610
Miss Utsugi! We're taking the Platinum Formation!

00:09:57.860 --> 00:09:58.610
Yes, sir!

00:09:58.700 --> 00:10:00.780
Mobile Unit, we're changing your formation.

00:10:01.200 --> 00:10:03.990
On the right, ChoRyuJin! On the left, Goldytank!

00:10:04.040 --> 00:10:05.160
Begin the attack!

00:10:05.370 --> 00:10:06.160
Roger!

00:10:06.370 --> 00:10:07.750
Just leave it to us!

00:10:10.170 --> 00:10:11.920
Now's your chance! Aim for the center!

00:10:12.250 --> 00:10:14.590
Right! Let's go, Pliers!

00:10:15.050 --> 00:10:17.010
Dimension Pliers!

00:10:18.010 --> 00:10:19.930
Tool Connect!

00:10:26.770 --> 00:10:27.520
What the...

00:10:32.400 --> 00:10:36.110
Unbelievable! He just repelled the warped space!

00:10:36.240 --> 00:10:38.860
A huge amount of energy that can even warp space!

00:10:46.870 --> 00:10:48.660
Is that your idea of a magic trick?

00:10:48.750 --> 00:10:50.330
What a feeble ploy!

00:11:04.260 --> 00:11:05.510
Laser response?

00:11:05.760 --> 00:11:06.720
In that case...

00:11:06.890 --> 00:11:08.560
Protect Shade!

00:11:16.530 --> 00:11:18.240
The laser got warped!

00:11:18.320 --> 00:11:20.150
Don't tell me it was those droplets of light!

00:11:20.450 --> 00:11:21.570
Apparently so.

00:11:21.610 --> 00:11:24.330
By instantly adhering aluminum to the glass fragments of the buildings...

00:11:24.410 --> 00:11:26.200
...he's using it as a laser reflector.

00:11:26.370 --> 00:11:29.750
Unbelievable! So he's calculating everything in a mere instant?

00:11:29.790 --> 00:11:32.580
Not only that, but he's using Tokyo's entire power supply for energy!

00:11:39.220 --> 00:11:41.130
That was a tough move, EI-01!

00:11:41.430 --> 00:11:44.180
But the battle is only just beginning!

00:12:04.450 --> 00:12:07.990
This isn't good! At this rate, I'm never gonna be able to get near him!

00:12:08.700 --> 00:12:09.370
What's that?

00:12:12.000 --> 00:12:14.790
I can feel an energy that's the same frequency as the Zonder Metal!

00:12:16.340 --> 00:12:19.050
That's not gonna be enough to hold us back, though!

00:12:25.050 --> 00:12:27.810
What's going on? I've got no power.

00:12:31.180 --> 00:12:35.400
The energy output from my GS-Ride is decreasing.

00:12:36.360 --> 00:12:37.150
No!

00:12:37.270 --> 00:12:39.110
What's going on, Professor?

00:12:39.360 --> 00:12:42.400
He's emitting the energy from the Zonder Metal at full blast.

00:12:42.610 --> 00:12:46.740
It's a type of energy that conflicts with the properties of the G-Stone.

00:12:46.870 --> 00:12:51.000
If the two energies collide, they'll end up canceling each other out!

00:12:51.290 --> 00:12:53.910
But if that's the case, the risk is the same for the enemy!

00:12:54.000 --> 00:12:55.290
You're forgetting something!

00:12:55.750 --> 00:12:59.000
EI-01 has Tokyo's entire power grid on his side!

00:12:59.550 --> 00:13:02.590
GaoGaiGar's remaining energy is at 26%!

00:13:03.420 --> 00:13:04.930
And it's draining steadily!

00:13:06.050 --> 00:13:10.430
We've got to act quickly, or the energy from the GS-Ride will be depleted!

00:13:10.680 --> 00:13:12.810
Then Gai, whose life depends on the G-Stone...

00:13:16.600 --> 00:13:19.400
Gai!

00:13:20.900 --> 00:13:23.650
O, you weak-willed souls...

00:13:23.740 --> 00:13:26.240
That to which you cling as your only hope...

00:13:26.450 --> 00:13:29.490
...Cain's legacy, the green-haired power...

00:13:29.700 --> 00:13:32.790
Behold as I eliminate him!

00:13:34.620 --> 00:13:38.830
Both ChoRyuJin and Goldymarg's power levels have fallen to 7.5%!

00:13:38.960 --> 00:13:41.630
There's no way to cut off the Kanto region power system!

00:13:42.500 --> 00:13:46.300
Who ever thought that the enemy would launch such a desperate attack!

00:13:47.380 --> 00:13:49.800
Chief! An eye for an eye...

00:13:50.390 --> 00:13:52.140
So let's give him energy for energy!

00:13:54.220 --> 00:13:55.350
You mean Bullet X?

00:13:58.270 --> 00:14:00.980
If there's a way to defeat him, that's got to be our only chance!

00:14:03.030 --> 00:14:05.190
I'm the most powerful cyborg known to mankind!

00:14:05.280 --> 00:14:07.400
No matter what happens, I'm coming back alive!

00:14:08.360 --> 00:14:09.780
So I'm asking you, please...

00:14:10.200 --> 00:14:12.080
...use Bullet X!

00:14:13.290 --> 00:14:14.080
Gai!

00:14:14.450 --> 00:14:16.210
Communication power going down...

00:14:16.410 --> 00:14:18.330
The audio's been cut off.

00:14:21.840 --> 00:14:22.800
Chief...

00:14:23.090 --> 00:14:24.840
Let's put our faith in Gai.

00:14:25.050 --> 00:14:27.260
To exceed the power of the enemy...

00:14:27.510 --> 00:14:28.970
The Ultimate Projectile, Bullet X...

00:14:30.050 --> 00:14:31.260
That's our only chance!

00:14:34.010 --> 00:14:35.430
I'm going to count on them.

00:14:35.600 --> 00:14:38.270
After all, they've pulled off so many miracles for us.

00:14:38.350 --> 00:14:40.230
I'm going to believe in their potential!

00:14:44.980 --> 00:14:47.280
All right! I'm going to break the seal now!

00:14:50.700 --> 00:14:54.540
All systems go! GS-Booster startup sequence launched!

00:14:54.790 --> 00:14:55.870
Locking down coordinates.

00:14:55.950 --> 00:14:58.790
Now calculating the angle of trajectory. Prepare for alignment!

00:15:05.050 --> 00:15:06.300
Ready to go!

00:15:06.630 --> 00:15:07.590
All right!

00:15:07.920 --> 00:15:08.970
Ultimate Projectile, Bullet X...

00:15:09.380 --> 00:15:09.970
Launch...

00:15:10.050 --> 00:15:10.970
...approved!

00:15:11.260 --> 00:15:12.180
Roger!

00:15:32.780 --> 00:15:35.910
Mic, I'm counting on you! Save all my friends, okay?

00:15:35.990 --> 00:15:38.250
Okay! That's a promise, all right?

00:15:39.960 --> 00:15:41.000
Wh-What's that?

00:15:49.380 --> 00:15:50.340
Here it comes!

00:15:54.890 --> 00:15:56.350
Thank you for your patience!

00:15:56.510 --> 00:15:57.510
So pathetic!

00:16:01.520 --> 00:16:04.230
How do you like the taste of these mirror particles?

00:16:04.690 --> 00:16:06.110
Hey, Mic, that's your cue!

00:16:06.230 --> 00:16:08.280
Yahoo!

00:16:08.610 --> 00:16:11.030
System Change!

00:16:20.250 --> 00:16:22.120
Come on! Rock 'n' roll!

00:16:23.210 --> 00:16:26.250
Razzle-Dazzle Double V!

00:16:32.170 --> 00:16:34.220
Okay, now's your chance, man!

00:16:34.550 --> 00:16:35.890
Hurry, get inside!

00:16:36.090 --> 00:16:37.180
Roger!

00:16:37.470 --> 00:16:38.720
Gotcha!

00:16:39.770 --> 00:16:40.970
I owe you one, Mic!

00:16:41.060 --> 00:16:43.690
Uncle Liger, just keep them safe for the next 60 seconds!

00:16:43.980 --> 00:16:46.690
60 seconds, huh? Piece of cake, man!

00:16:58.620 --> 00:17:00.620
All right, guys. You all know the deal, right?

00:17:00.700 --> 00:17:02.040
This is Bullet X...

00:17:03.710 --> 00:17:05.830
Captain, we are aware of the risks.

00:17:06.420 --> 00:17:08.340
And we wouldn't have it any other way.

00:17:08.540 --> 00:17:10.500
Come on, let's blast that thing out of here!

00:17:10.880 --> 00:17:14.380
All right! In order to defeat EI-01...

00:17:19.720 --> 00:17:21.100
The Ultimate Projectile, Bullet X...

00:17:21.140 --> 00:17:25.100
A device that, by releasing a sealed mass of G-Stone energy...

00:17:25.140 --> 00:17:29.020
...it explosively unleashes a surge of power beyond overload capacity.

00:17:29.110 --> 00:17:31.940
It is the ultimate miracle machine!

00:17:33.280 --> 00:17:33.940
Goddamn!

00:17:35.990 --> 00:17:37.240
No!

00:17:37.700 --> 00:17:38.910
How dare you!

00:17:45.160 --> 00:17:46.330
Big Brother!

00:18:28.000 --> 00:18:30.330
Let's do it!

00:18:39.430 --> 00:18:40.180
Impossible!

00:18:58.400 --> 00:19:00.110
Curses!

00:19:10.000 --> 00:19:12.880
So that's the power of Bullet X...

00:19:13.880 --> 00:19:17.880
If two diametrically opposed energies collide, they'll both be annihilated.

00:19:18.260 --> 00:19:21.010
But if one power surpasses the other...

00:19:21.050 --> 00:19:22.550
...the one left standing will be...

00:19:25.890 --> 00:19:28.640
Where's EI-01's core? Where the heck is it?

00:19:29.270 --> 00:19:30.520
Will Knife!

00:19:34.610 --> 00:19:35.940
Is that it?

00:19:36.440 --> 00:19:38.690
Goldymarg!

00:19:38.780 --> 00:19:39.780
Right!

00:19:42.280 --> 00:19:44.410
Hammer Connect!

00:19:48.450 --> 00:19:51.830
Goldion Hammer!

00:20:06.140 --> 00:20:07.060
What?

00:20:14.150 --> 00:20:15.690
EI-01!

00:20:16.610 --> 00:20:18.650
Transform into light!

00:20:45.640 --> 00:20:48.350
EI-01, energy level zero.

00:20:48.510 --> 00:20:50.310
He has been completely annihilated.

00:20:50.810 --> 00:20:52.060
Hooray!

00:20:52.600 --> 00:20:53.730
Huh?

00:20:56.900 --> 00:20:58.900
What's going on? You guys...

00:21:02.150 --> 00:21:03.280
Big Brother Gai!

00:21:11.830 --> 00:21:15.790
So he couldn't overcome his own destiny after all...

00:21:17.000 --> 00:21:20.420
All G-Stones showing energy levels of zero.

00:21:22.260 --> 00:21:24.300
All circuits disabled.

00:21:25.050 --> 00:21:26.220
Reboot...

00:21:26.800 --> 00:21:27.930
...impossible!

00:21:28.430 --> 00:21:31.100
Tell me it's not true, Big Brother Gai!

00:21:31.720 --> 00:21:32.810
Galeon!

00:21:33.020 --> 00:21:36.690
All of you, please answer me! Wake up, you guys!

00:21:37.810 --> 00:21:39.190
Big Brother Gai!

00:21:39.690 --> 00:21:41.650
Tell me you're all right!

00:22:12.600 --> 00:22:13.970
What's going on?

00:22:14.100 --> 00:22:17.310
A GGG agent shouldn't ever be caught crying.

00:22:17.850 --> 00:22:18.730
Huh?

00:22:33.660 --> 00:22:34.700
Gai!

00:22:35.250 --> 00:22:36.290
It's a miracle!

00:22:38.620 --> 00:22:40.130
Now that's what you call...

00:22:40.540 --> 00:22:41.670
...a true hero!

00:22:46.090 --> 00:22:49.990
You come floating down onto my planet.

00:22:51.190 --> 00:22:54.860
That's the dream I always have.

00:22:56.260 --> 00:23:01.040
Now you're looking up at the sky again...

00:23:01.040 --> 00:23:05.830
and you're searching for me.

00:23:06.460 --> 00:23:10.000
Longing to see you and be with you...

00:23:11.170 --> 00:23:16.930
I know I feel it just as strongly as you.

00:23:18.990 --> 00:23:23.690
Give us the wings to fly

00:23:23.690 --> 00:23:28.350
and set off into the galaxy.

00:23:29.040 --> 00:23:33.690
When you and I are grown up...

